## Any root-level path starting with an underscore is treated as local scratch
## (naming convention; no tracked file at repo root starts with _), so new
## diagnostic logs or temporary scripts need no extra .gitignore entries.
/_*

## dotnet test result directory (regenerated on every test run)
TestResults/

## Earlier diagnostic/build leftovers (named before the root underscore convention, so not covered by /_*; do not commit)
build_step*.txt
headless_step*.txt
test_*.txt
run_backfill*.ps1

## tools/audit: one-off probes and environment diagnostics (single investigation only; do not commit)
## Counter-examples: audit_*.py / audit_*.mjs / clean_*.py / inspect_cache.py / measure_rating.py
## These are permanent, offline-runnable, dependency-free audit guards, i.e. project assets already tracked.
tools/audit/diag_ps.ps1
tools/audit/launch*.ps1
tools/audit/launch*.mjs
tools/audit/logs.mjs
tools/audit/probe_*
tools/audit/proc.mjs
tools/audit/sess.mjs
tools/audit/*.txt
